[{"title":"鹭渚轻鸥","author":"李昌祺","text":"芳洲白鹭名，无数白鸥轻。\n暖戏桃花水，晴依柳絮萍。\n飞来兼早雁，散去避秋鹰。\n何处忘机客，时于此濯缨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39493,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄刘孟熙隐者","author":"李昌祺","text":"嵓壑幽栖者，閒情老不衰。\n露葵缘客折，晚稻约僧炊。\n苔径林风扫，松窗岭月窥。\n诗名兼逸兴，湖海万人推。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39494,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次衡州","author":"李昌祺","text":"征棹舣衡阳，孤城堞雉荒。\n流云时翳日，微雨暝生凉。\n江阔鸥波远，天空雁字长。\n采蘋无限兴，烟水晚苍茫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39495,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"己亥房山除夕营中作 其一","author":"李昌祺","text":"残腊中宵尽，孤怀百感深。\n已惭先哲训，徒抱古人心。\n偃息何由得，勤劳敢不任。\n寒灯照空榻，拥褐谩愁吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39496,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"己亥房山除夕营中作 其二","author":"李昌祺","text":"患难仍连岁，蹉跎独此身。\n风尘双短鬓，宇宙一穷人。\n向曙繁星没，凝寒积雪新。\n椒花今夕酒，谁寿白头亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39497,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"己亥房山除夕营中作 其三","author":"李昌祺","text":"稚子捐深爱，酸辛痛莫支。\n坐愁侵骨髓，行乐负心期。\n风俗殊方异，人情近老悲。\n前程驽马足，敢不慎驱驰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39498,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"己亥房山除夕营中作 其四","author":"李昌祺","text":"风雪当除夕，空营一榻孤。\n天涯悲舐犊，地下忆童乌。\n宁复衰颜壮，惟应泪眼枯。\n大灵如不妄，再拜谢玄夫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39499,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"己亥房山除夕营中作 其五","author":"李昌祺","text":"今夕犹常夕，如何倍忆家。\n二三千里道，四十五年华。\n贫有文章在，官无品秩加。\n遥知妻共女，愁坐卜灯花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39500,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"己亥房山除夕营中作 其六","author":"李昌祺","text":"警柝严巡逻，寒更独坐听。\n凄其孤影瘦，邪许万声停。\n败壁风穿苇，空庖凌在瓶。\n茫茫天壤内，么么一螟蛉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39501,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五峰庵住上人房","author":"李昌祺","text":"住公栖遁处，重到只空台。\n竹榻无僧扫，松关有客来。\n夕阳寒鸟集，凉露候虫哀。\n祗苑犹如此，何方免劫灰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39502,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中桃花","author":"李昌祺","text":"霢霂过芳园，枝枝积泪痕。\n色怜开处淡，香爱坠时闻。\n采倦蜂须湿，衔多鸟咮芬。\n东风解人意，吹片到衡门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39503,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"萧芳桂挽诗四首 其一","author":"李昌祺","text":"芳桂殒清秋，无人不泪流。\n通才今日少，遗恨几时休。\n苔藓碑三尺，楸梧土一丘。\n雁门前学士，地下与嬉游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39504,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"萧芳桂挽诗四首 其二","author":"李昌祺","text":"卜宅泸江曲，逢迎意最真。\n竹轩观奕倦，花屿放舟频。\n莫究平生志，先捐未老身。\n最怜黄壤魄，长梦绿窗人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39505,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"萧芳桂挽诗四首 其三","author":"李昌祺","text":"豪杰空馀子，尊贤眼倍青。\n挥金资客醉，辟馆教儿经。\n天道幽难测，亲情痛不胜。\n山阳怀旧笛，几度断肠听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39506,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"萧芳桂挽诗四首 其四","author":"李昌祺","text":"有志惜无年，香名远近传。\n客情千斛酒，岁计几庄田。\n吐论常倾坐，收书不吝钱。\n善祥钟令子，酷似乃翁贤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39507,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庚戌三月三日服阕之京舟次吉水","author":"李昌祺","text":"渐老怯离乡，那堪道路长。\n病身愁北去，倦翮恋南翔。\n旅梦缘钟断，忧怀藉酒忘。\n低回愧江叟，白首钓鱼航。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39508,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过清江","author":"李昌祺","text":"浦迥路迢迢，汀花带雨飘。\n残灯江上庙，新水屋边桥。\n鹭宿争投石，鸥惊或避桡。\n无因谢轩冕，老作白云樵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39509,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次洪都","author":"李昌祺","text":"春波拍岸平，双桨一舟轻。\n燕麦偏伤雨，莺花已负晴。\n荒亭徐孺宅，遗堞灌婴城。\n北去南来客，都缘利与名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39510,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟过南京","author":"李昌祺","text":"钟阜白云边，桥陵锁暮烟。\n圣谟真远矣，王气故依然。\n玉帛诸番会，金汤万世传。\n谁陈根本计，有力可回天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39511,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"尉氏县","author":"李昌祺","text":"县舍邻溱洧，门当绿野开。\n禽巢阶下树，蜗篆壁间苔。\n俗质稀弦诵，田荒剩草莱。\n宋金酣战处，武穆独奇才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39512,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿兴国寺","author":"李昌祺","text":"人静钟初断，肩舆到寺门。\n风檐寒犬吠，露井候虫喧。\n弱蔓低垂树，枯蓬密覆垣。\n蒲团分半席，暂憩给孤园。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39513,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长葛道中","author":"李昌祺","text":"郊原殊苍莽，禾黍未全收。\n桑柘千村晚，枌榆四野秋。\n空林投倦鸟，枯草龁疲牛。\n淡霭轻烟外，微茫见许州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39514,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚至叶县","author":"李昌祺","text":"扰扰道途间，埃尘两鬓斑。\n清风牛背笛，斜日马头山。\n荷盖擎残绿，榴房破嫩殷。\n蘋花秋水岸，空羡白鸥閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39515,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王乔观","author":"李昌祺","text":"王子飞凫处，仙遥迹尚存。\n城荒生暮霭，殿古锁秋云。\n坏壁灯烟暗，閒阶草气薰。\n古今为县者，神异独称君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39516,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留鲁山县","author":"李昌祺","text":"黎庶凋残甚，惟馀朴俭风。\n名因元子重，地本鲁王封。\n抚恤无贤令，流移有惰农。\n谁将于蔿曲，歌向五云中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39517,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中晓发","author":"李昌祺","text":"云气晓冥濛，人行万木中。\n菊乾偏喜雨，柳弱自愁风。\n绿鬓流年改，丹心往日同。\n明时叨重寄，无补愧诸公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39518,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀黄州滕太守","author":"李昌祺","text":"昔在南宫日，仙郎总俊髦。\n分符荣出牧，载笔忆联曹。\n身已朱幡贵，名犹粉署高。\n公馀频吊古，舣棹访临皋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39519,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"逢索员外话旧","author":"李昌祺","text":"相见仍青盻，相悲总白颠。\n功名怜蹭蹬，患难喜生全。\n小市三楹屋，荒村数亩田。\n南交同宦者，若个在林泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39520,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"内乡县","author":"李昌祺","text":"岩邑千山里，荒村户半逃。\n晓餐炊橡栗，寒火爇蓬蒿。\n深秀非盘谷，凋零类石壕。\n自伤无善政，抚问敢辞劳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39521,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新野即景","author":"李昌祺","text":"村暗濛濛雨，清流浅浅溪。\n菊花长带湿，豆荚半沾泥。\n野迥居民少，林昏去路迷。\n自投新野界，蒿草与人齐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39522,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中赴唐县","author":"李昌祺","text":"冒雨趍唐县，蓬蒿已厌看。\n长途泥滑滑，平地水漫漫。\n枵腹流民馁，单衣稚子寒。\n抚巡兼劳徕，衰病敢求安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39523,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿泌阳县田舍","author":"李昌祺","text":"民家深树里，下马点灯时。\n风雨关门早，衣裳拜客迟。\n艰难逢歉岁，逼迫后租期。\n说到伤心处，潸然泪满颐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39524,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过光州望马中丞墓","author":"李昌祺","text":"元运方全盛，公文擅大家。\n谨严真有法，悃愊信无华。\n故里祠堂废，荒阡墓碣斜。\n欲羞蘋藻荐，不敢驻行车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39525,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀元进士龚友孚","author":"李昌祺","text":"世运沧桑改，公名汗简留。\n六军怜骇散，四海竟横流。\n徒屈英雄策，空遗社稷忧。\n浮光垂白叟，仍解说才猷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39526,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚赴西平","author":"李昌祺","text":"晚涉西平境，荒郊望欲迷。\n暝烟村远近，寒树冢高低。\n驿路通淮甸，僧房隔汝溪。\n柏亭何处是，极目草萋萋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39527,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王侍读汝嘉挽诗 其一","author":"李昌祺","text":"识面嗟诚晚，论交觉独深。\n麟经三世业，蠹简一生心。\n诸老怜将尽，孤怀痛不禁。\n遗弦空自绝，无处觅知音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39528,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王侍读汝嘉挽诗 其二","author":"李昌祺","text":"阀阅衣冠盛，才名伯仲齐。\n宫袍裁赐锦，御酒拆封泥。\n屡握脩书笔，频分应制题。\n只今文燄在，犹自烛云霓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39529,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王侍读汝嘉挽诗 其三","author":"李昌祺","text":"少日边庭戍，曾驰草檄名。\n谈兵诸将屈，较艺众人惊。\n已并青城誉，仍兼玉署荣。\n九京那可作，恻怆起深情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39530,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王侍读汝嘉挽诗 其四","author":"李昌祺","text":"玉堂陪末议，荏苒七年馀。\n夜漏秋同听，春潮晓共趍。\n仲淹空有策，和靖却无书。\n垂老交游尽，临风泪满裾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39531,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿舞阳开元寺","author":"李昌祺","text":"驱车巡郡邑，夜夜宿僧房。\n窗掩芭焦雨，钟敲薜荔霜。\n一灯千虑集，孤枕五更长。\n无补惟宜退，先茔有草堂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39532,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归自南阳","author":"李昌祺","text":"去日犹秋暑，归时已冷霜。\n江山非故里，人物是他乡。\n老态随年出，离愁共路长。\n埃尘如见恋，到处扑衣裳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39533,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经息县","author":"李昌祺","text":"岁晏经新息，晨征念路遥。\n轻冰方尽合，残雪未全消。\n行客归心切，居民馁腹枵。\n停车徒自感，只合返渔樵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39534,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除日早饭田家","author":"李昌祺","text":"田家无节序，除日亦寻常。\n破釜初炊黍，空槽旋压浆。\n瓮寒齑结凌，窗湿纸粘霜。\n远役如堪免，长贫不敢伤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39535,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夕宿汝宁僧舍闻停止夫役喜而有作","author":"李昌祺","text":"除夕留僧寺，焚香对老禅。\n青灯伴今夜，黄历换明年。\n宵旰忧诚切，疮痍痛暂蠲。\n明晨呼万岁，顿首玉阶前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39536,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过殽陵关","author":"李昌祺","text":"春尽殽陵道，千山万木中。\n水声泉聒聒，云气雨濛濛。\n嫩草溪边石，幽禽树杪风。\n抱关黄发吏，宁解识终童。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39537,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"永思堂三首 其一","author":"李昌祺","text":"一自双亲逝，孤怀每自伤。\n恍疑闻謦欬，犹似见羹墙。\n厚禄嗟何及，遗言敢暂忘。\n番湖东去水，不似此情长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39538,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"永思堂三首 其二","author":"李昌祺","text":"人子思亲意，悠悠镇不穷。\n常时瞻画像，每日想音容。\n幽显虽云异，精诚或可通。\n哀悰真罔极，长系寸心中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39539,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"永思堂三首 其三","author":"李昌祺","text":"忆昔承欢日，沉思痛倍饶。\n梦魂劳夜夜，泪眼湿朝朝。\n儿鬓霜频积，亲茔树几凋。\n山夷河可塞，此恨未应销。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39540,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得骢马送别","author":"李昌祺","text":"骢马玉为蹄，行行过柳堤。\n云随金络辔，花映锦障泥。\n流电双瞳炯，摇风一尾齐。\n似知离别意，欲去更频嘶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39541,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题陈道士处静轩 其一","author":"李昌祺","text":"素性便孤寂，无营昼掩关。\n卧闻清露坠，坐见白云还。\n鹤梦棋敲醒，蜗墙藓蚀残。\n仙瓢休挂树，风起厌喧烦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39542,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题陈道士处静轩 其二","author":"李昌祺","text":"结宇汴城闉，开门见市人。\n轮蹄连旦暮，烟火杂军民。\n向闹寻閒处，随缘寄幻身。\n凡心如未泯，林壑亦埃尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39543,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题陈道士处静轩 其三","author":"李昌祺","text":"虚室原生白，寥寥一榻清。\n石坛云影度，金掌露光凝。\n叩齿宫神集，斋心道气澄。\n三尸能斩却，铅汞自然成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39544,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题陈道士处静轩 其四","author":"李昌祺","text":"轩车从扰扰，窗户自幽幽。\n药径人踪绝，苔阶鹤迹留。\n平生双短屐，浮世一虚舟。\n即此堪栖隐，何须物外游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39545,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春草二首 其一","author":"李昌祺","text":"苒苒复萋萋，征袍映欲迷。\n暖烟秦苑北，寒食杜陵西。\n绿嫩羞鹦羽，青柔衬马蹄。\n南园新雨过，畦菜晓争齐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39546,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春草二首 其二","author":"李昌祺","text":"秀色远相连，柔香雨霁天。\n嫩兼蒲叶细，浓夺柳条鲜。\n莫把征轮碾，留教醉客眠。\n王孙行未返，芳意自年年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39547,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚登汴城","author":"李昌祺","text":"休骑上荒城，斜阳万感并。\n岁怜频有旱，雷怪久无声。\n芳树鸠巢废，香泥燕垒成。\n缅怀前宋士，人艳道乡名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39548,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郭外野寺","author":"李昌祺","text":"野寺远人烟，觚棱殿兀然。\n瓦垆双足折，土偶半身全。\n鸟去阶留篆，蜗藏壁带涎。\n阎浮俱苦海，何处可安禅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39549,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立春日作","author":"李昌祺","text":"残历惟馀晦，殊乡又遇春。\n壮怀灰共冷，衰鬓雪争新。\n颇觉逢迎懒，徒思引退频。\n自缘忘物我，何用辨玒珉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39550,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻舍弟昌复讣 其一","author":"李昌祺","text":"闻讣心先折，开缄泪若倾。\n异乡离别恨，同气死生情。\n哽咽悲何已，呻吟痛曷平。\n九京知有憾，弱子尚孩婴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39551,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻舍弟昌复讣 其二","author":"李昌祺","text":"曾共过庭前，双亲独尔怜。\n亢宗徒赍志，阅世竟悭年。\n忍割今生爱，难期再世缘。\n永怀诸弟妺，三已在重泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39552,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻舍弟昌复讣 其三","author":"李昌祺","text":"五十年相聚，俄惊一梦馀。\n酸辛身后事，愁苦病中书。\n苔藓沙场骨，罗纨肉食躯。\n何如终牖下，随分葬郊墟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39553,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻舍弟昌复讣 其四","author":"李昌祺","text":"未病犹耽饮，方强遽解绅。\n短脩元有定，聚散本非真。\n藓碣标荒垄，桐棺掩幻身。\n达人曾祼葬，那用更伤神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39554,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春祭陪祀东书堂赐茶退归作","author":"李昌祺","text":"香篆半成灰，斋宫赐坐回。\n苑花红未拆，阶草绿先催。\n棋布星罗局，茶倾雪泛杯。\n非才叨岳牧，明祀几番陪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39555,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶然作","author":"李昌祺","text":"谬忝藩维寄，空惭老病身。\n鬓髭愁里雪，花柳客边春。\n直道乖流俗，馀生任化钧。\n时无邹孟氏，枉直向谁询。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39556,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"合欢牡丹三首应教作 其一","author":"李昌祺","text":"烂熳绚晴朝，容华若赛娇。\n瓣多愁露浥，干弱怯风摇。\n共讶晨妆淡，都缘宿酒消。\n更期千岁寿，岁岁赏妖娆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39557,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"合欢牡丹三首应教作 其二","author":"李昌祺","text":"花艳夺霞红，葩分妩媚同。\n斗妍云锦幄，竞秀绮罗丛。\n淑质俱倾国，凡英尽敛容。\n内庭和气盛，卉草最先钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39558,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"合欢牡丹三首应教作 其三","author":"李昌祺","text":"晓露湿芳英，骈开耻独荣。\n仙姿双弄玉，道韵两飞琼。\n人羡长偎倚，天令巧合并。\n鹊巢风化美，佳植固堪徵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39559,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"合欢芍药二首奉教作 其一","author":"李昌祺","text":"名品擅维扬，嫣然共颉颃。\n总专倾国艳，难辨是谁香。\n窈窕千般态，娉婷一种妆。\n螽斯端有兆，宜尔预呈祥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39560,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"合欢芍药二首奉教作 其二","author":"李昌祺","text":"楼子花王副，根同蒂亦连。\n固知皆雅淡，孰敢别蚩妍。\n绣阁云鬟并，妆台月貌联。\n暖风香雾里，向背总堪怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39561,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题小景四首 其一","author":"李昌祺","text":"南北两峰前，逢春物物妍。\n露桃临水岸，烟柳隔江船。\n古庙寻嘉泽，幽亭访冷泉。\n游人都载酒，来往六桥边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39562,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]